{"seq":3,"slug":"actions-consequences","title":"行为与后果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/mechanics/actions-consequences","wordCount":1497,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"行为与后果\">行为与后果</h1><p>《辐射：新维加斯》里有一个常被玩家忽略的细节：如果你偷东西时没被看见，声望不会掉；一旦有 NCR 士兵目睹，恶名立刻累积，而多人在场时惩罚更重。同一个「偷窃」动作，因为「谁看见了」而产生完全不同的后果。这条从「玩家做了什么」到「世界如何回敬」的管道，是声望系统真正被玩家体验到的地方。本篇是全 hub 行为-后果管道的主篇，串起前两篇的数值与关系，讲清行为如何被识别、如何换算成增量、以及跨过阈值后触发哪几类后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-行为到后果的三段管道\">核心概念：行为到后果的三段管道</h2><p>一次影响声望的事件，要走过三段处理：<strong>识别</strong>（这是个什么行为、归属哪个阵营、谁目击）→ <strong>换算</strong>（乘上情境系数得到增量，经关系图连带传播）→ <strong>兑现</strong>（更新分值、检查阈值、触发后果）。前两段前面已铺垫，本篇把它们接成一条完整管道并聚焦第三段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[游戏事件&lt;br/&gt;击杀/偷窃/交任务/救援] --&gt; B[识别&lt;br/&gt;行为类型 + 目标阵营 + 目击者]&#10;  B --&gt; C[换算增量&lt;br/&gt;Δbase × 目击 × 时机 × 量级]&#10;  C --&gt; D[关系图连带&lt;br/&gt;影响盟友与敌人]&#10;  D --&gt; E[更新分值并钳制]&#10;  E --&gt; F{跨越段位阈值?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[触发后果类别&lt;br/&gt;价格/服务/敌对/门控/事件]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[静默累积]\">flowchart TD\n  A[游戏事件&lt;br/&gt;击杀/偷窃/交任务/救援] --&gt; B[识别&lt;br/&gt;行为类型 + 目标阵营 + 目击者]\n  B --&gt; C[换算增量&lt;br/&gt;Δbase × 目击 × 时机 × 量级]\n  C --&gt; D[关系图连带&lt;br/&gt;影响盟友与敌人]\n  D --&gt; E[更新分值并钳制]\n  E --&gt; F{跨越段位阈值?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[触发后果类别&lt;br/&gt;价格/服务/敌对/门控/事件]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[静默累积]</pre><h2 id=\"哪些行为改变声望\">哪些行为改变声望</h2><p>不是所有玩家动作都该动声望，否则数值会噪声化。值得挂声望的行为通常有清晰的「阵营归属」和「道德/立场含义」。下表给出常见行为类别及其典型影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>典型影响</th>\n<th>是否需目击</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务完成</td>\n<td>帮阵营达成目标</td>\n<td>该阵营大幅加分</td>\n<td>否（结果可见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战斗击杀</td>\n<td>杀死某阵营成员</td>\n<td>该阵营减分、敌人加分</td>\n<td>通常需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盗窃/破坏</td>\n<td>偷窃、破坏据点</td>\n<td>减分</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>救援/施惠</td>\n<td>救 NPC、施舍</td>\n<td>小幅加分</td>\n<td>通常需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话选择</td>\n<td>立场性表态</td>\n<td>视措辞加减</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穿着/伪装</td>\n<td>穿敌方制服</td>\n<td>影响识别与敌意判定</td>\n<td>情境相关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「是否需目击」是设计上极关键的一列：让某些行为只在被看见时才计分，能鼓励潜行、伪装、灭口等玩法，也让世界显得更真实。目击判定通常复用 AI 的感知系统，见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/npc-behavior/perception-system\">跨库·感知系统</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"情境系数-同一动作的不同分量\">情境系数：同一动作的不同分量</h2><p>如 <a href=\"reputation-values\">声望数值与阈值</a> 给出的公式，单次增量是基础值乘若干系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>witness</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>timing</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>magnitude</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r = \\Delta_{\\text{base}} \\cdot m_{\\text{witness}} \\cdot m_{\\text{timing}} \\cdot m_{\\text{magnitude}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">witness</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">magnitude</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>本篇负责定义这些系数的<strong>语义与取值来源</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>witness</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{witness}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">witness</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（目击放大）：无人目击可为 0（行为不计分）或很小；单个目击者为 1；多名成员在场则放大（业界常见约 1.5 倍），因为「公然为之」的社会影响更大。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>timing</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{timing}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（时机）：剧情高潮、限时抉择等关键节点常给 2 倍，让「在紧要关头的选择」比日常琐事更重。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>magnitude</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{magnitude}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">magnitude</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（量级）：偷一枚硬币与洗劫金库不该等价，量级系数按行为的客观规模缩放。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些系数让声望数值贴近直觉，避免「反复做微小善行刷满声望」的荒谬——这类刷分套利正是 <a href=\"../practice/balancing-reputation\">平衡与调校</a> 要防范的头号问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五类后果\">五类后果</h2><p>当分值跨过某段位阈值，系统触发后果。后果大致分五类，从轻到重：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>经济后果</strong>：商店价格、掉落品质随声望浮动。高声望打折、低声望坐地起价甚至拒售。价格如何随声望缩放属于经济数值范畴，见 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/resources-currency\">跨库·资源与货币</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>服务后果</strong>：能否使用据点、治疗、休整、乘车等服务，按声望门控。</li>\n<li><strong>社交后果</strong>：NPC 的问候、对话选项、任务给予。低声望关闭一批对话，高声望解锁专属线，这条链接到 <a href=\"../../game-dialogue-systems/logic/variables-conditions\">跨库·对话变量与条件</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>敌对后果</strong>：声望低到一定段位，阵营主动敌视——拒绝入城、派出死亡小队、见面即战。这是玩家最强烈感知到的后果。</li>\n<li><strong>内容门控后果</strong>：整条任务线、区域、结局按声望开关。这类后果与任务系统深度耦合，其门控逻辑见 <a href=\"../../game-quest-objective-systems/logic/prerequisites-branching\">跨库·任务前置与分支</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"后果的可逆与不可逆\">后果的可逆与不可逆</h2><p>一个必须尽早拍板的设计问题：后果是否可逆？衰减机制（见数值篇）让多数经济、社交后果自然可逆——声望回升，态度回暖。但某些后果一旦触发就是永久的：一个 NPC 被死亡小队情节杀、一条任务线因某阵营覆灭而彻底关闭。不可逆后果戏剧张力最强，却也最危险——玩家若在不知情下永久锁死大量内容，会产生强烈挫败。稳妥的做法是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>让<strong>可逆</strong>作为默认，用衰减和「补偿性行为」给玩家回头路。</li>\n<li>仅在<strong>玩家能预期</strong>的重大抉择点使用不可逆后果，并通过表现层给出明确预警。</li>\n<li>记录后果的触发，以便存档正确恢复世界状态，见 <a href=\"../practice/reputation-persistence\">持久化与存档</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条「默认可逆、慎用不可逆」的原则，是把行为-后果管道从「惩罚陷阱」变成「有意义的选择」的关键，也是实践章反复回归的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>行为到后果是「识别→换算→兑现」三段管道，本篇把数值篇的增量与关系篇的连带接成完整链路。</li>\n<li>值得挂声望的行为需有清晰阵营归属与立场含义；「是否需目击」一列直接决定潜行/伪装玩法是否成立。</li>\n<li>情境系数（目击、时机、量级）让同一动作在不同处境下分量不同，防止微小善行刷分套利。</li>\n<li>后果分经济、服务、社交、敌对、内容门控五类，从轻到重，各自接入经济、对话、任务等兄弟系统。</li>\n<li>后果应默认可逆、慎用不可逆，不可逆仅用于玩家可预期的重大抉择并给足预警。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上游：<a href=\"reputation-values\">声望数值与阈值</a>、<a href=\"faction-relationships\">阵营关系图</a>。</li>\n<li>后果的呈现：<a href=\"../expression/npc-attitude\">NPC 态度与反应</a>、<a href=\"../expression/world-state-changes\">世界状态变化</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库·内容门控：<a href=\"../../game-quest-objective-systems/logic/prerequisites-branching\">任务前置与分支</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行为与后果","id":"行为与后果"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：行为到后果的三段管道","id":"核心概念-行为到后果的三段管道"},{"level":2,"text":"哪些行为改变声望","id":"哪些行为改变声望"},{"level":2,"text":"情境系数：同一动作的不同分量","id":"情境系数-同一动作的不同分量"},{"level":2,"text":"五类后果","id":"五类后果"},{"level":2,"text":"后果的可逆与不可逆","id":"后果的可逆与不可逆"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"阵营关系图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/mechanics/faction-relationships"},"next":{"title":"NPC 态度与反应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/expression/npc-attitude"}}